{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12176","headline":"初黄绶赴蓝田县作 · 钱起","name":"初黄绶赴蓝田县作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟠木无匠伯，终年弃山樊。\n苦心非良知，安得入君门。\n忽忝英达顾，宁窥造化恩。\n萤光起腐草，云翼腾沈鲲。\n片石世何用，良工心所存。\n一叨尉京甸，三省惭黎元。\n贤尹正趋府，仆夫俨归轩。\n眼中县胥色，耳里苍生言。\n居人散山水，即景真桃源。\n鹿聚入田迳，鸡鸣隔岭村。\n飡和俗久清，到邑政空论。\n且嘉讼庭寂，前阶满芳荪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}